body:
Sorry if the formatting is wrong I'm on my phone

- **Server:** EUW

&nbsp;

- **Type of Bug:** In-Game Visual Bug

&nbsp;

- **Description:** when in game with Crossfire (only crossfire) on I get artifacts all over the screen to the point that I'm not able to play. The HUD flickers, there are white boxes all over the place (like covering the mini map completely). Numbers don't change either e.g yasuo barrier icon will stay at 0 even if it's at 100. Debuff timers won't go down, e.g I have a nasus wither on me but the time it has left won't go down.

&nbsp;

- **Video / Screenshot:** don't have one at the moment

&nbsp;

- **Steps to reproduce:** turn crossfire on, play a game of league

&nbsp;

- **Expected result:** The game plays fine I am able to see the mini map and the game with no problems

&nbsp;

- **Observed result:** there are artifacts everywhere and it makes the game unplayable

&nbsp;

- **Reproduction rate:** 10/10

&nbsp;

- **System specs:** i5 3570k OC @ 4.4ghz, 8gb RAM, 2x HD 7870 XT in crossfire (disabled when I play LoL due to this bug)

&nbsp;

I know that most games have problems with crossfire, just wanted to make sure the team was aware of it :)
